          "label": "Residual risk",
          "text": "An attacker with the account password and the second factor can reset the vault. That destroys the victim's identity (availability) and installs one the attacker controls, which contacts detect only through the fingerprint change (L-07). A database-level attacker bypasses the API checks entirely (T-25, T-32)."
