          "text": "Daily backups of the database, the storage volume and the runtime secrets, encrypted with age to an offline key (CD-35); the operator copies backups off the VM; the restore drill verifies every table and every file object against the backup's digests; a documented restore onto an empty stack (cm-restore); disk and memory warnings in the platform status; no script deletes a volume."
